{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 28, "data": [{"docid2": 2232071, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育培训", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/jyj/zfxxgkml/gfxwjhqtzywj/202606/t20260626_2232071.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）教育局，市直属初中学校、职业院校（技工学校）：\n根据《福建省教育厅关于做好2026年中职本科“3+4”贯通培养试点工作的通知》《三明市2026年高中阶段学校招生录取办法》等文件精神，2026年中职本科“", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/jyj/zfxxgkml/gfxwjhqtzywj/202606/t20260626_2232071.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.26 08:24:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于调整中职本科“3+4”贯通培养试点项目招生批次及公布2026年面向三明市招生的中职本科“3+4”、五年制高职、中职学校（含技工学校）分专业招生计划的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教职成〔2026〕64号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2026-00097", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2026.06.24 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 2475437, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/jyj/zfxxgkml/gfxwjhqtzywj/202606/t20260626_2232071.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件：2026年面向三明市招生的中职本科“3+4”贯通、五年制高等职业院校和中等职业学校（含技工学校）招生计划.xlsx", "appdocid": 2232071, "appfile": "P020260626304046834302.xlsx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/jyj/zfxxgkml/gfxwjhqtzywj/202606/t20260626_2232071.htm", "fileext": "xlsx", "_src": "/protect/P0202606/P020260626/P020260626304046834302.xlsx", "_href": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/jyj/zfxxgkml/gfxwjhqtzywj/202606/P020260626304046834302.xlsx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/jyj/zfxxgkml/gfxwjhqtzywj/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2183819, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育培训", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202601/t20260114_2183819.htm", "content": "\n　　各参评人员：\n　　现将2024年度工程系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格材料领取有关事项通知如下：\n　　1.领取所需材料：本人持身份证原件；他人代领，应持代领人身份证原件+参评人员身份证原件，或持代领人身份证", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202601/t20260114_2183819.htm", "docreltime": "2026.01.14 11:34:00", "doctitle": "关于领取2024年度工程系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格材料的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2391165, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202601/t20260114_2183819.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202601/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2171832, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育培训", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251125_2171832.htm", "content": "\n　　2024年度三明市工程技术系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格评审工作已经结束，经评审，王怀俊等146位同志具备工程系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格，根据有关规定，现予以公示，公示期从2025年11月25至2025年12月1日", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251125_2171832.htm", "docreltime": "2025.11.25 08:52:00", "doctitle": "关于2024年度三明市工程技术系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格评审通过人员名单的公示", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2376660, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251125_2171832.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2170442, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育培训", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251119_2170442.htm", "content": "\n　　2024年度工程技术系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格评审会议于2025年11月21日下午至23日召开，现将《2024年度工程技术系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格评审答辩人员名单》和《参评人员考场纪律》予以通告，并就有关", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251119_2170442.htm", "docreltime": "2025.11.19 08:40:00", "doctitle": "关于2024年度工程技术系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格评审答辩安排的通告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2374982, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251119_2170442.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1：2024年度工程技术系列土建专业工程师职务任职资格评审答辩人员名单.xls", "appdocid": 2170442, "appfile": "P020251119312972564040.xls", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251119_2170442.htm", "fileext": "xls", "_src": "/protect/P0202511/P020251119/P020251119312972564040.xls", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/P020251119312972564040.xls"}, {"appdesc": "附件2：参评人员考场纪律.doc", "appdocid": 2170442, "appfile": "P020251119312972667488.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/t20251119_2170442.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202511/P020251119/P020251119312972667488.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/P020251119312972667488.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202511/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2130405, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育培训", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202506/t20250612_2130405.htm", "content": "\n　　明建项﹝2025﹞24号\n　　各有关单位：\n　　根据建筑施工特种作业人员有关管理规定，依照《福建省住房和城乡建设厅关于定期报送2025年度住建领域安全生产治本攻坚三年行动工作任务清单完成情况的通知》（闽建建安", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202506/t20250612_2130405.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.12 09:05:00", "doctitle": "关于2025年建筑施工特种作业人员岗位教育培训报名事宜通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327857, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202506/t20250612_2130405.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "建筑施工特种作业人员教育培训通知.pdf", "appdocid": 2130405, "appfile": "P020250612328214718747.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/rsxx/jypx/202506/t20250612_2130405.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202506/P020250612/P020250612328214718747.pdf", "_href": "http://www.